{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":21,"entries":[{"id":19441,"title":"Jeremiah 21:1","segments":["¶The word which came unto Jeremiah from the LORD, when king Zedekiah sent unto him Pashur the son of Melchiah, and Zephaniah the son of Maaseiah the priest, saying,"],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶The word","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" which came unto Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":" from the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", when king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" Zedekiah","strong":"H6667"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" unto him Pashur","strong":"H6583"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Melchiah","strong":"H4441"},{"text":", and Zephaniah","strong":"H6846"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Maaseiah","strong":"H4641"},{"text":" the priest","strong":"H3548"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":","}]},{"id":19442,"title":"Jeremiah 21:2","segments":["Enquire, I pray thee, of the LORD for us; for Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon maketh war against us; if so be that the LORD will deal with us according to all his wondrous works, that he may go up from us."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"Enquire","strong":"H1875"},{"text":", I pray thee, of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" for us","strong":"H1157"},{"text":"; for Nebuchadrezzar","strong":"H5019"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":" maketh war","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" against us; if so be that the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" will deal","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" with us according to all his wondrous works","strong":"H6381"},{"text":", that he may go up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" from us."}]},{"id":19443,"title":"Jeremiah 21:3","segments":["Then said Jeremiah unto them, Thus shall ye say to Zedekiah:"],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"Then said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":" unto them, Thus shall ye say","strong":"H559"},{"text":" to Zedekiah","strong":"H6667"},{"text":":"}]},{"id":19444,"title":"Jeremiah 21:4","segments":["Thus saith the LORD God of Israel; Behold, I will turn back the weapons of war that [are] in your hands, wherewith ye fight against the king of Babylon, and [against] the Chaldeans, which besiege you without the walls, and I will assemble them into the midst of this city."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:4","verse":4,"words":[{"text":"Thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"; Behold, I will turn back","strong":"H5437"},{"text":" the weapons","strong":"H3627"},{"text":" of war","strong":"H4421"},{"text":" that [are] in your hands","strong":"H3027"},{"text":", wherewith ye fight","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" against the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":", and [against] the Chaldeans","strong":"H3778"},{"text":", which besiege","strong":"H6696"},{"text":" you without","strong":"H2351"},{"text":" the walls","strong":"H2346"},{"text":", and I will assemble","strong":"H622"},{"text":" them into the midst","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" of this city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19445,"title":"Jeremiah 21:5","segments":["And I myself will fight against you with an outstretched hand and with a strong arm, even in anger, and in fury, and in great wrath."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:5","verse":5,"words":[{"text":"And I myself will fight","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" against you with an outstretched","strong":"H5186"},{"text":" hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" and with a strong","strong":"H2389"},{"text":" arm","strong":"H2220"},{"text":", even in anger","strong":"H639"},{"text":", and in fury","strong":"H2534"},{"text":", and in great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" wrath","strong":"H7110"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19446,"title":"Jeremiah 21:6","segments":["And I will smite the inhabitants of this city, both man and beast: they shall die of a great pestilence."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:6","verse":6,"words":[{"text":"And I will smite","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" the inhabitants","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" of this city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":", both man","strong":"H120"},{"text":" and beast","strong":"H929"},{"text":": they shall die","strong":"H4191"},{"text":" of a great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" pestilence","strong":"H1698"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19447,"title":"Jeremiah 21:7","segments":["And afterward, saith the LORD, I will deliver Zedekiah king of Judah, and his servants, and the people, and such as are left in this city from the pestilence, from the sword, and from the famine, into the hand of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon, and into the hand of their enemies, and into the hand of those that seek their life: and he shall smite them with the edge of the sword; he shall not spare them, neither have pity, nor have mercy."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"And afterward","strong":"H310"},{"text":", saith","strong":"H5002"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", I will deliver","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" Zedekiah","strong":"H6667"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", and his servants","strong":"H5650"},{"text":", and the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":", and such as are left","strong":"H7604"},{"text":" in this city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" from the pestilence","strong":"H1698"},{"text":", from the sword","strong":"H2719"},{"text":", and from the famine","strong":"H7458"},{"text":", into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of Nebuchadrezzar","strong":"H5019"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":", and into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of their enemies","strong":"H341"},{"text":", and into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of those that seek","strong":"H1245"},{"text":" their life","strong":"H5315"},{"text":": and he shall smite","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" them with the edge","strong":"H6310"},{"text":" of the sword","strong":"H2719"},{"text":"; he shall not spare","strong":"H2347"},{"text":" them, neither have pity","strong":"H2550"},{"text":", nor have mercy","strong":"H7355"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19448,"title":"Jeremiah 21:8","segments":["¶And unto this people thou shalt say, Thus saith the LORD; Behold, I set before you the way of life, and the way of death."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"¶And unto this people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" thou shalt say","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":"; Behold, I set","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" you the way","strong":"H1870"},{"text":" of life","strong":"H2416"},{"text":", and the way","strong":"H1870"},{"text":" of death","strong":"H4194"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19449,"title":"Jeremiah 21:9","segments":["He that abideth in this city shall die by the sword, and by the famine, and by the pestilence: but he that goeth out, and falleth to the Chaldeans that besiege you, he shall live, and his life shall be unto him for a prey."],"ref":"Jeremiah 21:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"He that abideth","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" in this city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" shall die","strong":"H4191"},{"text":" by the sword","strong":"H2719"},{"text":", and by the famine","strong":"H7458"},{"text":", and by the pestilence","strong":"H1698"},{"text":": but he that goeth out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":", and falleth","strong":"H5307"},{"text":" to the Chaldeans","strong":"H3778"},{"text":" that besiege","strong":"H6696"},{"text":" you, he shall live","strong":"H2421"},{"text":"","strong":"H2421"},{"text":", and his life","strong":"H5315"},{"text":" shall be unto him for a prey","strong":"H7998"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19450,"title":"Jeremiah 21:10","segments":["For I have set my face against this city for evil, and not for good, saith the LORD: it shall be given into the hand of the k